                <p>Not found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d146-f4" n="4" xml:id="d146-f4-content">
                <p> Hummel reported in telegram 1259 from Taipei, May 11, that he had taken the
                    matter up privately with Chiang Ching-kuo and Vice Foreign Minister Sampson
                    Shen, both of whom had expressed agreement. (Department of State, Central Files,
                    POL 1 CHICOM-US)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
